        "name": "Product Series",
        "datatype": "string",
        "description": "Manufacturer's series or family designation only, without the word \"series\" and without the manufacturer name. The anchor for part-number grammar induction, because the positional encoding of a smart part number is defined per series rather than per manufacturer.\n",
