        "name": "Drive Size",
        "datatype": "string",
        "description": "The output drive a powered driver, wrench or ratchet presents. A string because the values mix square-drive fractions with hex designations \u2014 1/2\" square and 1/4\" hex are different interfaces that a bare fraction could not distinguish.\n",
        "canonical_unit": null,
        "display_preference": null,
        "quantity_kind": null,
